WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step wide with a shorter stance than usual.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the front knee over the ankle.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Arms reach to the sides.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the belly soft and spacious.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
